  "note": "whisper failed: URLError: <urlopen error Tunnel connection failed: 403 Forbidden (agent proxy: no rule or network setting allows this host)>",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Gaadi sau ki speed par, aur saamne sadak par teen musibat!",
      "start": 0.18,
      "end": 3.405,
      "startFrame": 5,
      "endFrame": 102
    },
    {
      "text": "Ek bakri, ek bhains, aur beech sadak pe selfie leta ladka.",
      "start": 3.63,
      "end": 7.005,
      "startFrame": 109,
      "endFrame": 210
    },
    {
      "text": "Mummy boli, bhains ko mat maarna, poora gaon peeche padega.",
      "start": 7.2,
      "end": 10.125,
      "startFrame": 216,
      "endFrame": 304
    },
    {
      "text": "Pinki boli, bakri bahut cute hai!",
      "start": 10.26,
      "end": 12.69,
      "startFrame": 308,
      "endFrame": 381
    },
    {
      "text": "Aur ladka chillaya, mera video viral hoga!",
      "start": 12.69,
      "end": 15.135,
      "startFrame": 381,
      "endFrame": 454
    },
    {
      "text": "Papa ke haath kaanp gaye, ek clue screen pe hai, dhyan se dekho!",
      "start": 15.33,
      "end": 18.405,
      "startFrame": 460,
      "endFrame": 552
    },
    {
      "text": "A, bakri ko. B, steering ghuma ke khet mein. C, horn bajao, chalte raho. D, kisi ko nahi.",
      "start": 18.82,
      "end": 24.045,
      "startFrame": 565,
      "endFrame": 721
    },
    {
      "text": "Comment mein letter aur reason likho, sabse pehle sahi jawab ka naam part two mein!",
      "start": 24.21,
      "end": 28.155,
      "startFrame": 726,
      "endFrame": 845
    },
    {
      "text": "Sau se kam na chalaane wale dost ko bhejo, answer in the next reel, follow karo @rehanfact!",
      "start": 28.44,
      "end": 33.165,
      "startFrame": 853,
      "endFrame": 995
    }
  ],
